SUMMARY:🌿 Sacred Synergy: The Science & Alchemy of Letting Go • Radic
 al Forgiveness
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🌿 Sacred Synergy\n
 \n### The Science & Alchemy of Letting Go • Radical Forgiveness • Soun
 d • Breath • Movement\n\n**Sunday\, September 20\, 2026**\n\nJoin us f
 or an afternoon and evening of **Sacred Synergy**—a transformative commu
 nity gathering exploring the science\, alchemy\, and practice of letting g
 o\, forgiveness\, healing\, and liberation.\nInspired by the **Day of Aton
 ement (Yom Kippur)** and the Hebrew High Holy Days\, this gathering invite
 s us to explore how the practice of forgiveness can support greater well-b
 eing and create space for healing—within ourselves\, our relationships\,
  and our environment.\n\n✨ **Our journey unfolds in three parts:**\n🌳
  **4:00 PM — Tree Temple Ceremony & Potluck**\nGather in community for a
  special outdoor ceremony at the Tree Temple\, followed by a shared potluc
 k. Bring a dish\, a friend\, and an open heart.\n🔊 **6:00 PM — Sonic 
 Sanctuary**\n**“The Science and Alchemy of Forgiveness Through the Ages 
 and Stages”**\nExplore the evolution and transformative power of forgive
 ness through discussion\, **sound healing\, and breath alchemy**. This exp
 eriential session offers an opportunity to release\, renew\, and reconnect
 .\n💃 **7:30 PM — Ecstatic Dance**\n**“Unbinding the Chains”**\nMo
 ve beyond words and into embodied expression through an uplifting **Ecstat
 ic Dance** experience. Let movement become a pathway for releasing what no
  longer serves you and opening to greater freedom.\n\n🌟 **Come for one 
 part or experience the entire journey.**\nTogether\, we’ll explore the p
 ossibilities that emerge when we **let go\, forgive\, breathe\, listen\, m
 ove\, and reconnect**.\n\n💚 **All are welcome.** Come as you are and pa
 rticipate in the ways that feel right for you.\n\n📅 **Sunday\, Septembe
 r 20\, 2026**\n🕓 **4:00 PM – 9:00 PM**\n🌳 Tree Temple Ceremony & P
 otluck\n🔊 Sonic Sanctuary\n💃 Ecstatic Dance\n\n#SacredSynergy #Radic
 alForgiveness #LettingGo #SoundHealing #Breathwork #EcstaticDance #Healing
  #SpiritualCommunity #YomKippur #HighHolyDays #CommunityCommonsAsheville
