 X SOUND BATH ✨🍂**\n📅 Wednesday\\\, September 23 \\| 6:00–7:00 PM
 \n📍 Center for Spiritual Living Asheville — The Sanctuary\n🏡 2 Sci
 ence of Mind Way\, Asheville\, NC\n\nAs day and night come into balance\, 
 we’re invited to find balance within ourselves. 🌾\n\nJoin me for a de
 eply restorative evening of healing sound\, stillness\, grounding\, and ge
 ntle release. Allow the vibrations to quiet the mind\, settle the nervous 
 system\, and create space for what’s next. 🍁✨\n\n💰Sliding Scale:
  $10–$20\n🧘‍♀️ Bring: Yoga mat\, pillow\, blanket & eye mask\n
 ⏰ Please arrive 15 minutes early to get settled and choose your spot.\n\
 n🍂 Release what no longer serves you.\n🌙 Restore your inner balance.
 \n✨ Welcome the turning of the season.\n🎶 Serenity Sound Healing of A
 sheville\n\n*Rest. Restore. Rebalance.*\n\n#AutumnEquinox #SoundBath #Soun
